          .proof
            %h6#proof_12 Proof
            %p
              The statement follows immediately from the result (
              %a{:href => "#GelfandShilov66"}> Gel’fand-Shilov 66, III 2.10 (7), p 294
              ), see
              %a{:href => "Cauchy+principal+value#FourierTransformOfDeltaDistributionappliedToMassShell"} this prop.
            %p
              We make this fully explicit now in the special case of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spacetime"} spacetime
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dimension"} dimension
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi p
                    %mo +
                    %mn 1
                    %mo =
                    %mn 3
                    %mo +
                    %mn 1
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                    p + 1 = 3 + 1
            %p
              by computing an explicit form for the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/causal+propagator"} causal propagator
              in terms of the
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/delta+distribution"} delta distribution
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Heaviside+distribution"} Heaviside distribution
              and
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+function"} smooth
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bessel+functions"} Bessel functions
            %p
              We follow (
              %a{:href => "causal+perturbation+theory#Scharf95"}> Scharf 95 (2.3.18)
              ).
            %p
              Consider the formula for the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/causal+propagator"} causal propagator
              in terms of the mode expansion
              = succeed "." do
                %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:CausalPropagatorModeExpansionForKleinGordonOnMinkowskiSpacetime"} (10)
